      "message": "feat(observability): add OpenTelemetry tracing cookbook (#922)\n\nNew notebook showing how the Python SDK and the Claude API emit\nOpenTelemetry spans and how the traceparent header joins them into one\ntrace. Covers a Messages API request attribute by attribute, nesting and\ncontent mode, streaming, the tool runner, a Managed Agents session with a\ncustom tool round trip, OTLP export, and adding a Console destination for\nthe API's spans.\n\n:house: Remote-Dev: homespace",
