      "message": "feat(managed_agents): move plan-big-execute-small to multiagent_20261001 (#915)\n\nThe recipe now sets the multiagent_20261001 type. The small-model worker\nis listed under subagents.predefined_agents, and subagents.inline_agents\nand workflows are set to disabled, so every delegated task goes to the\nlisted worker.\n\nAlso in this change:\n- \"coordinator\" becomes \"orchestrator\" in the title, the prose, names in\n  code, print labels, the diagram's label, registry.yaml and the README\n  row. The file name is unchanged, and so is the metadata tag.\n- The prose and the two system prompts name the tools the orchestrator\n  delegates with (create_agent, send_to_agent, list_agents) and the tool\n  a worker reports with (send_to_parent).\n  The orchestrator's prompt no longer names wait_for_agents, and the\n  worker's no longer names submit_result.\n- Section 1 now says only that the orchestrator can't see its workers'\n  system prompts. It used to say it could see nothing about them.\n- Prerequisites point to the docs for the multiagent block.\n- The SDK floor is anthropic>=1.13.0.\n- COOKBOOK_COORDINATOR_MODEL, the earlier name of\n  COOKBOOK_ORCHESTRATOR_MODEL, is still read when the new name is unset.\n- A stale comment about Sonnet 5's introductory price is removed.\n- Links to the docs point at the multiagent orchestration page.\n- The prose says the figures it quotes come from the authors' runs made\n  before this move.",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "92aac1cc2ea76cea5f4ea98caccdd77d66445cd6",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-cookbooks/git/trees/92aac1cc2ea76cea5f4ea98caccdd77d66445cd6"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-cookbooks/git/commits/39cd5a7a3a29a73e7391e17b7644c51f34a6aaa1",
